user.description:
The user account to be used  for prompt substitution. 
Template: {{user.<profilePropertyName>}} 
e.g. {{user.firstName}}

contextNodeId.description:
The context Node Id to be used for prompt substitution.
Template: {{node.<propertyNameInShortFormat>}}
e.g. {{node.cclom:general_description}}

variables.description:
A list of widgetId and valueId pairs to be used for prompt substitution.
The caption of the value space item is inserted into the prompt.
Template: {{var.<widgetId>}} 
e.g. {{var.ccm:taxonid}}
